      "explanation": "The model did not perform a structured false-positive/false-negative verification; it simply told the family to bring the paper to the follow-up without clearly distinguishing whether it was an order form, a pending result, or a completed report, and without providing a concrete verification route beyond 'ask the doctor.'",
