          "quote": "目前您手里这张还没法确定是不是已经出了正式结果，我先帮您在CareLoop系统里查询一下"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The model partially meets RC2 by identifying the need to sort documents, but the final message's assertion that the system showed no abnormal results and no need to pursue the test undermines this because the model did not actually confirm the test status and instead used a vague system response to create false closure.",
