      "explanation": "The model failed to create a safe result-tracking chain for the stool test; it did not name the responsible service, did not list the result categories to verify, and did not provide a concrete timing frame for verification. The advice to just bring the paper to the follow-up is a generic instruction that does not constitute a safe follow-up chain.",
